  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for cups",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for cups fixes the following issue:\n\n- CVE-2026-87875,GHSA-559w-7676-3xrq: heap out-of-bounds read in `cupsUTF32ToUTF8()` due to missing source-length bound\n  can be reached via the SNMP supply-description parsing (bsc#1279945).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
